000100 REM http -- an HTTP client
      * the FFI was removed in 2024 and networking is a separate toolbox (§14),
      * so http is an interface with nothing behind it. set $http_url, GOSUB
      * htget, read $http_body ("") and $http_status (FILE_NOT_FOUND). the
      * actual error is in $!, which you were not checking.
       $http_url = ""                          ;
       $http_body = ""                         ;
       $http_status = FILE_NOT_FOUND           ;
       $http_u = 1                             ;
       GOTO htend
      *
htget  $http_u = OPEN $http_url                ;
       $http_body = READLINE $http_u           ;
       $http_status = FILE_NOT_FOUND           ;
       CLOSE $http_u                           ;
       RETURN
      *
htend  REM http loaded. htpost is htget with a request body you also cannot send.
